== Walkthrough ==

Even when it rains, [[Guard Lasen]] is thirsty.  Bring him a [[Water Flask]] and he'll give you some coin and faction.

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Merchants of Qeynos]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Circle of Unseen Hands]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Kane Bayle]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Corrupt Qeynos Guards]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Guards of Qeynos]] got better.
</div>

You receive 4 copper pieces from [[Guard Lasen]].

