The xp was very good for 1-10 or so, but I wasn't keeping track of exact percentages so I wont list them here.

At level 14 the xp seemed to take a big hit so I decided to time a small sample of turn-in's to decide if the quest was still worth doing. In 8 minutes, I was able to go from 24% into level 14 to 61% into level 14. That comes out to a little more than 4% xp per minute at a cost of slightly more than 1 gold per 1% xp. This is extremely tedious, but a fast and cheap form of leveling 1-14ish if you don't care about being KOS with Corrupt Qeynos Guards. It cost less than 60pp to level from 1-14 as a Half Elf druid solely doing this quest.

'''Note: This quest will make you KOS with Corrupt Qeynos Guards quickly. Also note, [[Guard Lasen]] spawns at 6am game time and despawns at 8pm game time, the quest cannot be done at night.'''

